entertaining).  

	With recorporealization, spoiled players will always 
carry a wand of turn undead, and they sometimes get an extra life
(straightforward, not as entertaining).  A very few fluke survivals
become a larger number of pre-planned survivals.

	I would be inclined to rule out recorporealization, even
though things like consistency and behaving like real life are good
to have.

